cuems-midi-connector (0.1.0-2) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * The code the field actually runs: 0.1.0-1 + branch
    fix/mtc-dedup-realtime-flags (connector.py md5 d6467785, identical on
    the 4 Medina boxes, the test rigs and alq3, where it was hand-installed).
    0.1.0-1's note that it was "the version the rc1-era fleet runs" was
    wrong: the fleet runs this connector.py.
    - Real-time flags on the MtcMaster -> Midi Through subscription, so ALSA
      dedupes it instead of doubling MTC quarter-frames (fa88dfe, 869djtm9j).
    - from_through wiring deferred on the new-client path, so a player's own
      subscription wins the race at cold boot (9af92bb, e670215; "DMX dead
      on cold boot").

